Z||000015||CoolBlue87GT||08-11-2001||07:34 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by CanadianGT:<BR><B>It's to bad you could not get more pictures........Did you run out of film or something?  LOL</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, I decided to leave some out !  I actually had 1120 pic's left !!  The new camera I was trying out actually will hold 1300 pic's ! It's a SONY Mavica MVC300, it uses a mini CD rewritable disk.<P>The car there this year were fantastic. Hope these pic's help those that couldn't make it see how nice it was.<P>I've got a few more I'll post later, as I'm off to work now.  Glad you enjoyed them.<BR>||||reg||6
